{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773081358,"nonce":"TKPQINmV5LtJp7FDp6iZZTXsWjs=","title":"Console rich view streaming: agent response never appears despite consoleStreamHandler fix","message":"After fixing consoleStreamHandler (payload.data → payload spread), the user prompt still appears in rich view but the assistant response never arrives. Possible root cause: Claude Code in interactive mode (--output-format stream-json without --print) may not emit newline-terminated stream-json events that feedLineParser can parse — VT100 TUI rendering may replace/overwrite lines rather than appending them, so JSON never appears as a complete \\n-terminated line in the stream. Needs investigation: (1) does claude --output-format stream-json without --print emit parseable stream-json to stdout? (2) if not, alternative: use --print mode with stdin piping, or a different structured output channel.","files":null}]}